WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.864
Today your child reads each sentence three times. Each time has its own job.

2
00:00:05.314 --> 00:00:07.893
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:08.393 --> 00:00:11.857
Read one. Work it out. It may be slow, and that is fine.

4
00:00:12.307 --> 00:00:16.027
It may sound like this. I, sat, on, the, bus, in, the, sun.

5
00:00:16.727 --> 00:00:21.614
Read two. You read it smoothly, sliding your finger. Then your child says it after you.

6
00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:23.559
I sat on the bus in the sun.

7
00:00:24.359 --> 00:00:27.279
Read three. Say: now tell it to me, like talking.

8
00:00:27.729 --> 00:00:32.688
Your child marks a box after each read. There are three boxes under every sentence.

9
00:00:33.138 --> 00:00:38.730
Do not correct in the middle. Wait until the end of the sentence. Then say: try that one again.

10
00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:44.555
For job two, press play on the sound track and step away. Your child reads a sentence.

11
00:00:45.005 --> 00:00:49.210
The voice waits, then reads the same sentence smoothly. That is read one.

12
00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:53.618
After the track, your child reads each sentence two more times, alone.

13
00:00:54.068 --> 00:00:57.587
At the end, your child reads one sentence to you, the third way.
